\subsection*{Comment}

The unresolved question concerns arbitrary complex states satisfying
\eqref{eq:p40-ame-condition}.  Existing no-go results cover minimal-support
states and canonical $\mathbb{Z}_{4}$ graph states, but do not rule out
non-minimal-support $\mathbb{F}_{4}$ stabilizer states or non-stabilizer
constructions.

